            {
              "text": "AKS・Bastion リソースの閲覧者ロールが必要。承認済み IP 範囲には Bastion の IP を追加",
              "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified",
              "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/ja-jp/azure/bastion/bastion-connect-to-aks-private-cluster", "locator": "必要な役割 / その他の要件", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-21T22:20:00Z" }]
